{"kind":"cross_cutting_capability","title":"数据分析与经营反馈","description_origin":"analyst_synthesis","summary":"支持跨域的数据采集、定义、分析和反馈。它不是固定排在十域之后的第十一步。","source_ids":["S1","S2","S4","S5"],"applicable_business_models":["self_operated","marketplace","agency"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"cross_cutting_capability","title":"风险控制","description_origin":"analyst_synthesis","summary":"用户、交易及业务风险控制跨域协同。监管和支付规则须另按正式渠道核对，不依专业文章作法律结论。","source_ids":["S1","S2"],"applicable_business_models":["self_operated","marketplace","agency"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"cross_cutting_capability","title":"权限与审计","description_origin":"analyst_synthesis","summary":"按角色和数据范围管理访问与操作留痕；不将系统权限直接当经营流程替代。","source_ids":["S1","S4"],"applicable_business_models":["self_operated","marketplace","agency"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"business_model_condition","title":"自营/品牌零售","description_origin":"analyst_synthesis","summary":"核对商品货权、库存、采购、交付和经营利润责任。平台自营与第三方入驻业务线应分开。","source_ids":["S1","S5"],"applicable_business_models":["self_operated"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"business_model_condition","title":"第三方平台","description_origin":"analyst_synthesis","summary":"增加商家入驻、经营支持/监督、资料状态管理、商家佣金及货款结算；不默认平台持有全部货物或可自由归集交易资金。","source_ids":["S1","S4"],"applicable_business_models":["marketplace"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"business_model_condition","title":"代运营服务","description_origin":"analyst_synthesis","summary":"服务范围、收费、验收及采购责任依合同确定。S5中品牌线上管理/营销服务为该公司用语，不是行业统一定义。","source_ids":["S5"],"applicable_business_models":["agency"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"source_limit","title":"库存锁定时点","description_origin":"analyst_synthesis","summary":"不把S1的支付成功后锁库存描述写成唯一做法；预占、锁定、扣减和释放时点由交易策略与并发控制约定。","source_ids":["S1","S2"],"applicable_business_models":["self_operated","marketplace","agency"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"source_limit","title":"售后适用规则","description_origin":"analyst_synthesis","summary":"不采纳虚拟商品一概不支持售后的泛化说法。售后依商品性质、合同、平台规则及适用要求判断。","source_ids":["S1"],"applicable_business_models":["self_operated","marketplace","agency"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"scope_exclusion","title":"跨境扩展","description_origin":"analyst_synthesis","summary":"S3的海外市场、头程、海外仓、清关、外币及当地税务不作为本数据集国内共性主树。","source_ids":["S3"],"applicable_business_models":["self_operated","marketplace","agency"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"scope_exclusion","title":"分期融资与软件项目交付","description_origin":"analyst_synthesis","summary":"S1分期信贷和S4第18、19项软件项目交付不纳入电商经营主树。","source_ids":["S1","S4"],"applicable_business_models":["self_operated","marketplace","agency"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"applicability_note","node_id":"ecommerce-practice-reference__v0.1__2026__zh:1.4","summary":"预算与资源属于基于经营/营销策划所作的分析展开，不宣称原文给出这一完整标准过程。","source_ids":["S5","S1"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"applicability_note","node_id":"ecommerce-practice-reference__v0.1__2026__zh:1.6","summary":"代运营或专业服务合作情境；品牌与服务方按实际合同确认授权、范围及责任。","source_ids":["S5"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"applicability_note","node_id":"ecommerce-practice-reference__v0.1__2026__zh:4.4","summary":"第三方商家入驻模式专用。纯自营企业不必设置独立平台招商流程。","source_ids":["S1"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"applicability_note","node_id":"ecommerce-practice-reference__v0.1__2026__zh:4.5","summary":"平台向入驻商家提供服务并实施经营监督的情境。","source_ids":["S1"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"applicability_note","node_id":"ecommerce-practice-reference__v0.1__2026__zh:4.6","summary":"商家生命周期在S1中出现，暂停/退出与权限交接是分析展开；细则依平台合同和规则。","source_ids":["S1"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"applicability_note","node_id":"ecommerce-practice-reference__v0.1__2026__zh:7.2","summary":"库存预占/锁定/扣减/释放及优惠试算时点需按具体交易策略确认，不把“支付后才锁库存”当通用规则。","source_ids":["S1","S4"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"applicability_note","node_id":"ecommerce-practice-reference__v0.1__2026__zh:9.3","summary":"售后按商品性质、合同、平台规则及适用要求判断，不采用“虚拟商品一律无售后”等绝对规则。","source_ids":["S1","S2"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"applicability_note","node_id":"ecommerce-practice-reference__v0.1__2026__zh:10.2","summary":"需要承担或受托采购结算职责时才适用；不能据“代运营”标签推定其购买货物或承担库存风险。","source_ids":["S2"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"applicability_note","node_id":"ecommerce-practice-reference__v0.1__2026__zh:10.3","summary":"第三方平台与商家清结算情境；支付清分与资金处理按合规服务及合同安排，不推定平台可自行归集资金。","source_ids":["S1","S2"],"is_official":false}
{"kind":"applicability_note","node_id":"ecommerce-practice-reference__v0.1__2026__zh:10.4","summary":"S5说明服务费/提点等收费模式；计费核对、账单和回款跟踪是据此作出的操作级展开。","source_ids":["S5"],"is_official":false}
